{"seq":2,"slug":"groundwater-aquifers","title":"地下水与含水层：达西定律与井流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/surface-groundwater/groundwater-aquifers","wordCount":1486,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"地下水与含水层-达西定律与井流\">地下水与含水层：达西定律与井流</h1><p>打一口井，抽上来的水可能在地下已经待了几百上千年。地下水是淡水中最大的可用储库，却也是最隐蔽、最易被透支的一种——你看不见它的水位下降，直到井干、地面下沉。当 <a href=\"../hydrological-cycle/runoff-watershed\">径流与流域</a> 中的下渗补给把水送入地下，水就进入了一个全新的运动逻辑：在多孔介质中缓慢渗流。本篇是整个 hub 里地下水力学的唯一主讲篇，核心是达西定律，并由它推出含水层分类与井流计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>地下水储存在含水层（aquifer）这种能给出可观水量的透水岩土层中。地下水的运动不同于河流的明渠流，而是水在岩土孔隙间的渗流（seepage），其速度极慢、由水头差驱动。理解地下水，先要建立「储水—导水—流动」三个基本属性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;降水/地表水&quot;] --&gt;|下渗补给| B[&quot;包气带&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;潜水面&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;潜水含水层&lt;br/&gt;无压&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|越流| E[&quot;弱透水层&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;承压含水层&lt;br/&gt;有压&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|达西渗流| G[&quot;泉/河道排泄&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|抽水| H[&quot;降落漏斗&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt;|抽水| H\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"降水/地表水\"] --&gt;|下渗补给| B[\"包气带\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"潜水面\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"潜水含水层&lt;br/&gt;无压\"]\n  D --&gt;|越流| E[\"弱透水层\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"承压含水层&lt;br/&gt;有压\"]\n  D --&gt;|达西渗流| G[\"泉/河道排泄\"]\n  D --&gt;|抽水| H[\"降落漏斗\"]\n  F --&gt;|抽水| H</pre><p>下表对比两类主要含水层，它们在受压状态、水位响应与开采风险上差异显著。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>含水层类型</th>\n<th>上覆条件</th>\n<th>水位形态</th>\n<th>抽水响应特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>潜水（无压）含水层</td>\n<td>直接接大气</td>\n<td>自由潜水面</td>\n<td>直接疏干孔隙，降深较大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承压含水层</td>\n<td>上有弱透水层</td>\n<td>测压水位高于顶板</td>\n<td>释放弹性储水，可形成自流井</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"达西定律-地下水流动的统领方程\">达西定律：地下水流动的统领方程</h2><p>地下水力学的基石是达西定律（Darcy&#39;s law），由 Henry Darcy 于 1856 年通过砂柱实验得出。它指出，通过多孔介质的流量与水头梯度成正比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>A</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = -K A \\frac{dh}{dl}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是流量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 是渗透系数（hydraulic conductivity，反映介质导水能力，砂砾石大、黏土极小），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是过水断面积，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dh}{dl}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是水力梯度（水头沿流动方向的变化率），负号表示水从高水头流向低水头。把流量除以面积得到达西流速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q = -K \\frac{dh}{dl}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，注意它是表观流速，真实的孔隙水流速还要除以有效孔隙度，因而更快。</p>\n<p>达西定律之于地下水，正如 <a href=\"rivers-lakes-hydrology\">河流与湖泊水文</a> 中曼宁公式之于河流——都是把流量与可测的几何与梯度联系起来的本构关系。它的适用前提是层流（雷诺数较小），在岩溶大孔隙或井附近高速流处会失效。渗透系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 跨越十几个数量级（砾石到黏土），是地下水问题中最关键也最难精确获取的参数，决定了污染物运移的快慢——而地下水一旦污染极难恢复的原因，正源于其极长的滞留时间，见 <a href=\"../hydrological-cycle/intro-and-core-concepts\">水文学导论</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"含水层类型与储水机制\">含水层类型与储水机制</h2><p>按受压状态，含水层分为潜水含水层和承压含水层。潜水（无压）含水层的顶部是自由的潜水面，直接与大气相通，补给来自上方下渗，水位随补给与开采升降明显。承压含水层夹在两个弱透水层之间，水承受着超过大气压的压力，钻井时测压水位会高于含水层顶板，若高于地面则形成自流井（artesian well）。</p>\n<p>两类含水层的储水机制不同，用储水系数（storativity）刻画单位水头变化释放的水量。潜水含水层主要靠重力疏干孔隙（给水度，数量级 0.1–0.3），承压含水层则靠水和岩土骨架的弹性压缩释水（弹性储水系数，数量级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），后者小得多。这个差异有重大现实后果：长期超采承压水会压缩骨架、导致不可逆的地面沉降，这正是华北平原与许多大城市面临的难题，其规模与治理见 <a href=\"../frontiers-challenges/water-scarcity-security\">水危机与水安全</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"井流与降落漏斗\">井流与降落漏斗</h2><p>向含水层抽水，井周围的水位会下降形成漏斗状的降落漏斗（cone of depression），水从四周向井汇流。稳定状态下的承压含水层径向井流由 Thiem 公式描述：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = \\frac{2\\pi T (h_2 - h_1)}{\\ln(r_2/r_1)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = K b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是导水系数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 为含水层厚度），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_1, h_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是距井 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_1, r_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 处的水头。该式表明，降深随距离呈对数衰减——井附近降得急、远处趋平。对于非稳定流，则用 Theis 公式描述抽水过程中降深随时间的演变，它是含水层参数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 和储水系数）现场抽水试验反演的理论基础。</p>\n<p>降落漏斗的概念解释了许多现实问题：相邻井的漏斗叠加会导致干扰、加剧降深；过密布井或长期超采使区域水位持续下降，漏斗连片，形成大范围地下水位降落区。地下水的可持续开采，本质是把开采量控制在补给量之内，使水位不致长期单向下降——这一约束是 <a href=\"../water-resources-management/assessment-allocation-iwrm\">水资源评价与配置</a> 中地下水可开采量评价的核心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>地下水力学的核心概念关系如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((地下水与含水层))&#10;    达西定律&#10;      Q=-KA·dh/dl&#10;      渗透系数K&#10;    含水层类型&#10;      潜水无压&#10;      承压有压&#10;      自流井&#10;    储水机制&#10;      给水度&#10;      弹性储水&#10;    井流&#10;      降落漏斗&#10;      Thiem/Theis\">mindmap\n  root((地下水与含水层))\n    达西定律\n      Q=-KA·dh/dl\n      渗透系数K\n    含水层类型\n      潜水无压\n      承压有压\n      自流井\n    储水机制\n      给水度\n      弹性储水\n    井流\n      降落漏斗\n      Thiem/Theis</pre><ul>\n<li>地下水储存在含水层中，以多孔介质渗流的方式缓慢运动，是最大的可用淡水储库也最易被透支。</li>\n<li>达西定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>A</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = -K A \\frac{dh}{dl}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是地下水力学的统领方程，渗透系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 跨十几个数量级，是最关键参数。</li>\n<li>含水层分潜水（无压，靠重力给水度）与承压（有压，靠弹性储水）两类；超采承压水会引发不可逆地面沉降。</li>\n<li>抽水形成降落漏斗，Thiem/Theis 公式描述稳定与非稳定井流，是抽水试验反演参数的基础。</li>\n<li>可持续开采要求开采量不超过补给量，这为后续地下水可开采量评价与超采治理提供了理论闸门。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"地下水与含水层：达西定律与井流","id":"地下水与含水层-达西定律与井流"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"达西定律：地下水流动的统领方程","id":"达西定律-地下水流动的统领方程"},{"level":2,"text":"含水层类型与储水机制","id":"含水层类型与储水机制"},{"level":2,"text":"井流与降落漏斗","id":"井流与降落漏斗"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"河流与湖泊水文：地表水的运动与结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/surface-groundwater/rivers-lakes-hydrology"},"next":{"title":"水质与水生态：从溶解氧到生态流量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/surface-groundwater/water-quality-ecology"}}